{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12651","headline":"系乐府十二首 欸乃曲 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 欸乃曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁能听欸乃，欸乃感人情。\n不恨湘波深，不怨湘水清。\n所嗟岂敢道，空羡江月明。\n昔闻扣断舟，引钓歌此声。\n始歌悲风起，歌竟愁云生。\n遗曲今何在，逸爲渔父行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}